Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:03:01.57,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\be1}thì trong ánh quang lung linh rạng ngời ấy,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:07.95,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\be1}{\kf114}ko{\kf25}to{\kf21}ba {\kf78}mo {\kf64}o{\kf40}mo{\kf54}i {\kf46}mo {\kf30}ze{\kf16}n{\kf121}bu
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:07.95,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\be1}từng lời nói và trọn vẹn nỗi niềm đều khẽ đong đưa.
